insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('0e1ec56d-5db4-51b9-adde-f1076b0c966a', 'wg6-argument-writing-p05', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g6-argument-writing'), null,
        '6-8', $q$Swimming in Gym Class$q$, $q$(1) Lakeside Middle School sits just three blocks from Harbor Lake, yet many of its students cannot swim. (2) The school should add a four-week swimming unit to physical education class. (3) The community pool is right across the street, so students could walk there during class. (4) Knowing how to swim keeps people safe near water. (5) Swimming is also a sport that people can enjoy for their whole lives.

(6) Some families might object that a swimming unit would cost too much. (7) Actually, the community pool already offers free lane time to schools on weekday mornings. (8) ______ the only real cost would be a few boxes of swim caps.

(9) Other people say that students can simply take lessons in the summer. (10) Summer lessons fill up quickly, though, and many families cannot drive their children to the pool. (11) A school unit would reach every student, not only the lucky ones.

(12) Every student deserves the chance to be safe and confident in the water, and a swimming unit would give them that chance.$q$, 'draft')
