   $q$Which sentence, added after sentence (10), would best support the writer's response?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Last year, the town's summer swim classes were full within two days of opening sign-ups.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Summer is the most popular season for swimming in most towns.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"does-not-support-rebuttal"},{"text":"The writer's older brother did not learn to swim until he was ten.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"weak-anecdote"},{"text":"Some families prefer to hire private swim coaches for their children.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"weakens-claim"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Last year, the town's summer swim classes were full within two days of opening sign-ups.$q$, $q$Sentence (10) says summer lessons fill up quickly, and classes filling in two days is evidence for that. The fact that summer is a popular swimming season does not show that lessons are hard to get.$q$, 'draft', '0e1ec56d-5db4-51b9-adde-f1076b0c966a')
