insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('745b6cb3-71ed-51a2-9095-43738fa98ddb', 'wg6-argument-writing-p06', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g6-argument-writing'), null,
        '6-8', $q$Keep Art Twice a Week$q$, $q$(1) Next year, Maplewood Middle School plans to cut art class from two days a week to one. (2) This change would be a mistake, and the school should keep art class twice a week. (3) Art teaches students to solve problems in creative ways. (4) When a clay sculpture keeps falling over, students must test new ideas until one works. (5) Art also gives students a calm break during a busy school day. (6) The art room has two sinks and a big window.

(7) The principal explains that the extra time would go toward math practice. (8) Math is certainly important. (9) ______ students who take art regularly often do just as well in math as those who do not. (10) Some researchers believe that art builds the same careful thinking that math requires.

(11) Art class is not just for fun. (12) It helps students think, create, and focus, and Maplewood should protect it.$q$, 'draft')
