-- Passage wg6-narrative-writing-p07
insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('e38778cb-fb63-546c-813b-79a1dc902f6d', 'wg6-narrative-writing-p07', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g6-narrative-writing'), null,
        '6-8', $q$Pebble the Snail$q$, $q$(1) For the technology fair, my friend Amara and I decided to make a short stop-motion movie. (2) Our star was a clay snail named Pebble, who was trying to cross a garden path. (3) We set a tablet on a stack of books, pointed it at the path, and took our first photo. (4) Then we moved Pebble a tiny bit and took another. (5) We did this over and over for two whole afternoons. (6) When we finally played our movie, I groaned. (7) Pebble did not glide smoothly. (8) He jumped around the screen, and in some pictures the whole path seemed to shake. (9) "The tablet moves every time we tap it," Amara said. (10) Clay comes in many bright colors at the craft store.

(11) We had to start over. (12) This time, we taped the tablet to the books so it could not budge. (13) We also used a timer so we never had to touch the screen. (14) The next week, we played our new movie for the class. (15) Pebble slid across the path as smoothly as a real snail.

(16) That is how we made our movie.$q$, 'draft')
