   $q$Which transition best fills the blank at the beginning of sentence 5?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Finally,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-time-order"},{"text":"As a result,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"false-cause"},{"text":"In contrast,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contrast-for-addition"},{"text":"At the same time,","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$At the same time,$q$, $q$Chlorophyll does two things during the summer: it helps make food and it covers other colors, so "At the same time" links the two jobs. "As a result" is wrong because making food is not what causes the other colors to be covered.$q$, 'draft', 'e45c72f9-d437-5611-b5c8-cd682f747d1f')
