   $q$Read the paragraph from a report on octopuses: (1) "Octopuses have three hearts." (2) "They can change the color of their skin to match their surroundings." (3) "Honestly, they're kinda freaky." (4) "Their arms contain many nerve cells." Which sentence breaks the formal tone of the report?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Sentence 3","is_correct":true},{"text":"Sentence 4","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-tone"},{"text":"Sentence 1","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-tone"},{"text":"Sentence 2","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-tone"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Sentence 3$q$, $q$Sentence 3 uses "Honestly," "kinda," and "freaky," which sound like casual talk. The other sentences state facts in plain, formal language.$q$, 'draft', null)
