   $q$Which words best fill blank (10)?$q$, $q$[{"text":"In other words","is_correct":true},{"text":"For example","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-transition-example"},{"text":"On the other hand","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-transition-contrast"},{"text":"First of all","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-transition-sequence"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$In other words$q$, $q$Sentence 10 restates what the evidence in sentences 7 and 9 means, so "In other words" fits. "For example" is wrong because sentence 10 is an explanation of the evidence, not a new example.$q$, 'draft', '57c6f2bc-8caf-5da4-a17a-ba763a6c770e')
