-- Passage wg6-writing-with-evidence-p03
insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('9ddeec85-6a0e-54b0-b4a3-cb4c9f2dc948', 'wg6-writing-with-evidence-p03', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g6-writing-with-evidence'), null,
        '6-8', $q$Draft: Small Fields, Big Skills$q$, $q$(1) In "Small Fields, Big Skills," Grace Mbeki explains why many youth soccer leagues now play on smaller fields with fewer players. (2) ____. (3) Mbeki writes that on a small field with four players on each team, every player touches the ball far more often. (4) She describes one league where players touched the ball "about three times as often" after the switch. (5) More touches mean more chances to practice dribbling, passing, and shooting.

(6) Small games also help players think quickly. (7) Mbeki explains that with less space, players must decide what to do with the ball in just a second or two. (8) ____, they learn to look up and notice their teammates before the ball arrives. (9) Soccer is played in almost every country in the world. (10) Mbeki adds that coaches saw young players making smarter passes by the end of the season.

(11) In conclusion, soccer is fun.$q$, 'draft')
on conflict (id) do update set title = excluded.title, body = excluded.body
where public.passages.status = 'draft';
