   $q$How does sentence (8) strengthen the writer's response to the teachers' concern?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It shows that the stickers are cheap enough for the club to buy.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-evidence-location"},{"text":"It gives the result of a real test showing that the dots did not make the view harder to see.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It explains why birds are unable to see clear glass windows.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-evidence-location"},{"text":"It restates the teachers' worry about the view in different words.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-counterclaim-and-response"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It gives the result of a real test showing that the dots did not make the view harder to see.$q$, $q$Sentence (8) reports the science club's test, which is evidence that directly answers the worry about blocking the view. The cost of the stickers comes in sentence (9), not sentence (8).$q$, 'draft', 'c42445ce-0a05-5ad9-ac2d-0786dfeff77e')
