insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('f792b05e-1f42-5786-bf89-4ef0adb08d11', 'wg7-argument-writing-p03', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g7-argument-writing'), null,
        '6-8', $q$Ultimate Disc for Gym Class$q$, $q$(1) In physical education at Rivera Middle School, we rotate through the same three sports every year: basketball, volleyball, and soccer. (2) Ultimate disc should be added to the seventh grade gym schedule. (3) In this game, players pass a flying disc down a field and score by catching it in an end zone. (4) The game requires constant running, so students get a strong workout. (5) It also has no referees, which means players must call their own fouls and settle disagreements fairly. (6) This rule teaches honesty and teamwork in a way that few other sports do.

(7) Some students say ultimate disc is too hard to learn. (8) Throwing a disc does take practice, but most beginners can make short passes after one class. (9) Our gym teacher, Mr. Okafor, already owns twelve discs from a summer camp he ran. (10) The school would not need to buy much new equipment.

(11) Ultimate disc combines exercise with fairness and cooperation. (12) It is time for Rivera to give this sport a turn on the schedule.$q$, 'draft')
