   $q$Which sentence, if added after sentence (1), would best explain why the current schedule is a problem?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Many famous athletes started playing soccer when they were very young.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"off-topic-evidence"},{"text":"Basketball was the first sport our school ever offered when it opened.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-history"},{"text":"The volleyball nets are stored in the closet behind the auditorium stage.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-detail"},{"text":"Students who dislike these three sports often sit out and miss the exercise gym class is meant to provide.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Students who dislike these three sports often sit out and miss the exercise gym class is meant to provide.$q$, $q$This sentence shows a real problem with offering only three sports, which gives a reason to add a new one. The choices about basketball's history, the volleyball nets, and famous soccer players are facts that do not point to any problem.$q$, 'draft', 'f792b05e-1f42-5786-bf89-4ef0adb08d11')
