   $q$Which sentence would best replace sentence (10) as a conclusion?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The district technician should simply work faster when visiting Lakeside.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-solution"},{"text":"Computers have changed a great deal since they were first invented.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-general"},{"text":"Laptops are useful in class, but printed books are useful too.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"off-claim"},{"text":"A student help desk would return laptops faster and teach volunteers useful skills, so Lakeside should start one this year.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$A student help desk would return laptops faster and teach volunteers useful skills, so Lakeside should start one this year.$q$, $q$The correct choice restates the claim and sums up the two main reasons from the essay. The choice about the technician working faster offers a new idea the essay never supports.$q$, 'draft', '7ae270f9-354d-5e65-a996-1c19e1be7c85')
