  ('854e7cfc-5c04-5955-93b3-d3fe1fb44696', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g7-argument-writing'), null, 'medium',
   $q$Which choice best replaces sentences (11) and (12) with a formal conclusion that follows from the argument?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Spanish and French are also beautiful languages that students enjoy.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"off-claim"},{"text":"Hiring a new teacher costs money, so the class may have to wait.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-claim"},{"text":"Sign language is beautiful and would be really cool to learn.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"keeps-informal-tone"},{"text":"Because sign language would connect us with our neighbors and could be taught at no cost, Oakdale should offer it next fall.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Because sign language would connect us with our neighbors and could be taught at no cost, Oakdale should offer it next fall.$q$, $q$The correct choice is formal and sums up the main reason and the answer to the cost concern. The choice about waiting for money ignores the free instructor in sentence (9) and abandons the claim.$q$, 'draft', '70fcefbf-c1f5-532e-ac30-8d490034c0d7')
